# A bill in the owner's mail: a line 3 days before it is due. Its trigger
# (bill-due) lists the bills due in 3 days; each is said once.
workflow bill
subject mail
about A bill in your mail: a line 3 days before it is due, with who, how much and when.
start trigger:bill-due
tag no
limits steps 3, days 1

step tell
say Bill due {event.due} (in 3 days): {event.from}. {event.amount}
end
